      "details": "\r\n<p>Both the BTCGI and Manni 1981 mention the identification of Phorbantia with Bucinna, but do not appear to be entirely convinced. The BTCGI lists Phorbantia with the modern name of Levanzo, but has an additional separate entry for \"Bucinna\".</p>\r\n",
